# =============================================================================
# DevFlow — Environment Variables
# =============================================================================
# This project runs entirely locally with IndexedDB (Dexie.js).
# No environment variables are required — just npm install && npm run dev.
#
# If you want to run the Python backup scripts, you can optionally set:
#   SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
# The desktop client still uses a Supabase project; configure its key only in a
# local .env file for your own private instance. Never commit credentials.
#   SUPABASE_KEY=your-private-project-key
# =============================================================================
